oiler":false,"text":"Although retired, she is still considered to be the strongest warrior in the world, and is the rival of the Demon King."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86664"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者の母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母性にあふれ、おしとやかで優しいが、正義の心は強く根は真面目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて邪神を倒した褒美として神から、処女のまま娘を授かっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現役を退いているが最強の存在で魔王に警戒されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『蒼天の戦乙女（グロリアス・ワルキューレ）』の名で呼ばれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22034","sourceWorkId":"28771","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者の母。母性にあふれ、おしとやかで優しいが、正義の心は強く根は真面目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて邪神を倒した褒美として神から、処女のまま娘を授かっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現役を退いているが最強の存在で魔王に警戒されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『蒼天の戦乙女（グロリアス・ワルキューレ）』の名で呼ばれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73650"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43ad2987cf41ade6ac4b6132aa9d695307f268f43faf1188eece6a366ba245bd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6bf8ab3c364b54cafc23d2db783eb7605c2216348939301423288acd2fdf7bc3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雨宮侑布","creatorId":"vndb:s1450","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1450","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1450","name":"雨宮 侑布","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:295422:73650:4940:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c86665","characterName":"サラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"73651","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295422"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22035"],"vndbCharacterId":"c86665"},"originalCharacterName":"サラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lucia's daughter. The heir to her bravery. She has a strong sense of justice and a passionate character. She has multiple cheats as a result of her mother's training and the God's grace. In terms of physical ability, she surpasses her mother, but is held back by her short temper and her immaturity."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86665"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルシアの娘。次代の勇者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールぶってツンとした態度を取るが、優しい心を持ち、正義感が強く熱い性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親ゆずりの素質と神の恩恵の力で潜在能力は随一であるチート少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体能力や才能面では母をもこえる最強であるが未熟さと短慮さが弱点。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『蒼剣の継承者（ティルフィング・サクセサー）』の名で呼ばれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22035","sourceWorkId":"28771","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルシアの娘。次代の勇者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールぶってツンとした態度を取るが、優しい心を持ち、正義感が強く熱い性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親ゆずりの素質と神の恩恵の力で潜在能力は随一であるチート少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体能力や才能面では母をもこえる最強であるが未熟さと短慮さが弱点。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『蒼剣の継承者（ティルフィング・サクセサー）』の名で呼ばれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73651"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fda23c0f5b5c9f1236fc9780aa8a22be02d207e8fc5a267d0e9f4b891cf87af1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a90bd5bca16c8dc18bb195e80b9ea9d5da0621e72b88410198cd72f1508bfca.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水野七海","creatorId":"vndb:s2524","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2524","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2524","name":"星野七海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:295422:73651:17078:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c86666","characterName":"カーラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"73652","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295422"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22036"],"vndbCharacterId":"c86666"},"originalCharacterName":"カーラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Demon King. She has lived since the age of mythology from even before humans were born. She had rebuilt the demon tribe after they collapsed from the death of the evil gods, and is invading the earth as the Demon King of a new generation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she lives for so long, she believe humans are like insects and that demons should reign supreme in the world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is strict on herself and others, and despises incompetence. When she tried to summon the God of Destruction, she accidentally summoned the main character."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c86666"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間が生まれる以前の神話の時代から生きており、邪神が滅んだことで一気に衰退した魔族を立て直し、今代の魔王として地上を侵略している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠久の時を生きる彼女にとって人間は虫けら同然で、魔族こそが世界の主であるべきと考える魔族至上主義。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自他ともに厳しく能力がある上に努力を怠らず、無能が嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"破壊神を召喚しようとして主人公をよんでしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『殺戮の淑女（ブラッディ・クイーン）』の名で呼ばれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22036","sourceWorkId":"28771","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔王。人間が生まれる以前の神話の時代から生きており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"邪神が滅んだことで一気に衰退した魔族を立て直し、今代の魔王として地上を侵略している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠久の時を生きる彼女にとって人間は虫けら同然で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔族こそが世界の主であるべきと考える魔族至上主義。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自他ともに厳しく能力がある上に努力を怠らず、無能が嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"破壊神を召喚しようとして主人公をよんでしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『殺戮の淑女（ブラッディ・クイーン）』の名で呼ばれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73652"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-